{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.copySlice\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">copySlice</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">src</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">srcOff</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">dest</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">destOff </span><span class=\"fn\">len</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">exact</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Copies the elements of `src` from index `srcOff` up to, but not including, `srcOff + len` into\n`dest` starting at index `destOff`, growing `dest` if necessary. The copy works in place when `dest`\nis not shared and has room. If `exact` is `false`, the capacity is doubled when `dest` grows.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.copySlice","kind":"def","line":432,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.copySlice","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L432-L441"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.instAppend\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">instAppend</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Append\">Append</a> <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.instAppend","kind":"instance","line":414,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.instAppend","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L414-L414"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.append\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">append</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends the elements of `b` to `a`, in place when `a` is not shared and has room.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.append","kind":"def","line":409,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.append","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L409-L412"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a c