>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.pushImpl","kind":"def","line":359,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.pushImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L359-L370"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.pushGrowUnsafe\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">pushGrowUnsafe</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int16\">Int16</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`push` when `a` is full: copies `a` with capacity `2 * capacity + 1`, then appends `v`. Out of\nline so that inlined `push` call sites stay small. Public only so that `push` can be inlined into\ncode in other modules.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.pushGrowUnsafe","kind":"def","line":344,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.pushGrowUnsafe","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L344-L357"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.instGetElemUSizeInt16LtNatToNatSize\"><