der":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureExclusiveWithCapacity\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureExclusiveWithCapacity</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `a` itself when it is not shared and has room for `n` elements, and otherwise a single copy\nwith room for exactly `max n a.size` elements. Logically this is the identity. It is useful before a\nrun of in-place writes and pushes, so that none of them copies.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureExclusiveWithCapacity","kind":"def","line":182,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureExclusiveWithCapacity","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L182-L188"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl","kind":"def","line":173,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureExclusiveWithCapacityImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L173-L180"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureCapacity\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureCapacity</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `a` itself when it has room for `n` elements, and otherwise a copy with room for exactly\n`max n a.size` elements. Logically this is the identity. Unlike `ensureExclusiveWithCapacity`, it\ndoes not copy `a` just because it is shared.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureCapacity","kind":"def","line":165,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureCapacity","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L165-L171"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureCapacityImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureCapacityImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureCapacityImpl","kind":"def","line":158,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureCapacityImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L158-L163"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureCapacityGrowUnsafe\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureCapacityGrowUnsafe</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`ensureCapacity` and `ensureExclusiveWithCapacity` when `a` lacks room for `n` elements: copies `a`\nwith room for exactly `max n a.size` elements. Out of line so that inlined call sites stay small.\nPublic only so that those functions can be inlined into code in other modules.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureCapacityGrowUnsafe","kind":"def","line":146,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.ensureCapacityGrowUnsafe","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L146-L156"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureExclusive\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">ensureExclusive</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `a` itself when it is not shared, and a copy otherwise. Logically this is the identity.\nIt is useful before a run of in-place writes, so that only the first one can copy.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureExclusive","kind":"def","line":133,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.ensureExclusive","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L133-L141"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_he