html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Stores `v` at index `i` in place. Only valid when `a` is exclusive and `i` is in bounds. Public only\nso that `uset` can be inlined into code in other modules.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.setUnsafe","kind":"def","line":120,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.setUnsafe","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L120-L126"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.getImpl\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">getImpl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.size\">size</a></span> := by get_elem_tactic)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int16\">Int16</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"For internal use only.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.getImpl","kind":"def","line":110,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.Internal.getImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/