y.Int16Array.mk\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/SInt/Basic.html#Int16\">Int16</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\">Int16Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `Int16Array` whose elements are `a`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array.mk","kind":"def","line":43,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L43-L45"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">Int16Array</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Arrays of `Int16` values, stored unboxed in a scalar array, 2 bytes per element.\n\nThe logical model is an `Array Int16`: `Int16Array.mk` and `Int16Array.toArray` convert\nbetween the two. `cases` and `induction` split a `Int16Array` as `mk a`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.html#ScalarArray.Int16Array","kind":"def","line":24,"name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/Int16/Basic.lean#L24-L35"}}],"imports":["Init","Init.Data.Iterators.Lemmas.Basic","Init.Data.Slice.InternalLemmas","ScalarArray.Internal","Std.Data.Iterators"],"instances":[{"className":"Decidable","name":"ScalarArray.Int16Array.decSizeLt","typeNames"